{
  "abstract": "In the binomial-moment linear program for the largest probability that all k-wise independent Bernoulli bits are 1, every interior exceptional basis transition at bias p has a reflected exceptional transition at bias 1-p. This establishes Conjecture 5.11 of Berend, Ernst, Kontorovich and Kumar over its full stated range of n and even k; it does not address the rationality of breakpoints.",
